---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  sticky={false}
  title={siteConfig.cta.label}
  description="Book a 25-minute intake audit with Stephen Adeniji: how after-hours calls, forms and ad leads are handled at your firm today."
>
  <PageHero
    title={siteConfig.cta.label}
    lead="A look at how calls, forms and ad leads are handled after hours at your firm today, and whether it's worth fixing."
  />

  <section class="sec wrap split" id="schedule" aria-labelledby="sched-title">
    <h2 id="sched-title">Pick a time</h2>
    <div class="split__body">
      {siteConfig.bookingUrl ? (
        <div class="scheduler"><iframe src={siteConfig.bookingUrl} title="Booking calendar" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
      ) : (
        <div class="scheduler">
          <p><Placeholder>booking URL. Founder must confirm cal.com/practiceop/audit or Calendly</Placeholder></p>
          <p class="muted small">The scheduler appears here once the booking link is set in src/config/site.ts.</p>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec wrap split" aria-labelledby="call-title">
    <h2 id="call-title">What happens on the call</h2>
    <div class="split__body">
      <p>The call walks through what happens today when a call, a web form or an ad lead comes in after hours. Who answers, how fast, and where it gets written down.</p>
      <p>At the end you'll know whether there's anything worth fixing. If there isn't, that's the answer.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec wrap split" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <h2 id="contact-title">Email</h2>
    <div class="split__body">
      {siteConfig.email ? <p><a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a></p> : <p><Placeholder>contact email</Placeholder></p>}
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
